---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service — StrangerHelp">
  <Navbar />
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-[1400px] px-4 py-12 md:px-6">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <p class="font-medium text-xs text-mute uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-ink tracking-[-1.28px]">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-mute">Last updated: June 21, 2026</p>

      <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 text-sm text-body leading-relaxed">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-3">1. About StrangerHelp</h2>
          <p>StrangerHelp is a hyperlocal task marketplace that connects people who need tasks done with verified helpers in their area. We also provide a crowdsourced community information platform.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-3">2. User Responsibilities</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-5">
            <li>You must provide accurate information during registration</li>
            <li>You are responsible for all activity under your account</li>
            <li>You must not post illegal, harmful, or fraudulent tasks</li>
            <li>You must complete claimed tasks in good faith</li>
            <li>You must not harass, threaten, or abuse other users</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-3">3. Payment Terms</h2>
          <div class="p-4 bg-warning-soft rounded-lg border border-warning/20">
            <p class="font-medium text-warning-deep">⚠️ Direct Payment — No Escrow (Current)</p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-body">Currently, all payments are made directly between the task poster and the task claimer. StrangerHelp does not process, hold, or guarantee any payments.</p>
            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-5 text-body">
              <li>The task poster is responsible for paying the claimer upon task completion</li>
              <li>The claimer should verify payment arrangement with the poster via messages before starting work</li>
              <li>Payment method (UPI, cash, etc.) is agreed upon between both parties</li>
              <li>StrangerHelp is not liable for payment disputes between users</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-mute">The Karma Wallet with built-in escrow protection is coming soon.</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-3">4. Task Claiming</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-5">
            <li>By claiming a task, you agree to complete it to the best of your ability</li>
            <li>You must verify the payment terms with the task poster before proceeding</li>
            <li>Completion proof (photos, receipts, documents) must be uploaded for verification</li>
            <li>Repeatedly claiming and abandoning tasks may result in account suspension</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-3">5. Messages & Data</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-5">
            <li>All messages are stored for accountability and dispute resolution</li>
            <li>Messages may be reviewed by StrangerHelp staff only in case of reported disputes</li>
            <li>We do not share message content with third parties</li>
            <li>Payment confirmations should be exchanged via messages for your records</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-3">6. Prohibited Activities</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-5">
            <li>Posting tasks involving illegal activities</li>
            <li>Sharing false or misleading information in the Q&A section</li>
            <li>Creating fake accounts or impersonating others</li>
            <li>Attempting to bypass platform features for fraud</li>
            <li>Spamming or posting irrelevant content</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-3">7. Account Termination</h2>
          <p>We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate these terms. You may delete your own account at any time from Settings.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-3">8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>StrangerHelp is a platform connecting users. We are not responsible for the quality of task completion, payment disputes, or interactions between users. Use the platform at your own discretion.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-ink mb-3">9. Contact</h2>
          <p>Questions about these terms? Email <a href="mailto:legal@strangerhelp.com" class="text-link">legal@strangerhelp.com</a></p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
